		{
			"id": "t6pi3NSFSo7VrXzTV",
			"name": "Drone Casing (Light)",
			"reference": "B46",
			"local_notes": "DR 30 all round, flak-class. Sensor eyes are not armoured separately (treat as DR 15).\n\nLore: A gun drone's casing is light composite: tougher than a Fire Warrior's flesh, less than his armour. Background: the drone is meant to be expendable.\n\nDesign: Damage Resistance (B46-47, 5/level), 30 levels = 150 points. DR 30 matches the framework's flak anchor; the drone is designed to be cheap, so it is not carapace. Other drone types override the levels.",
